# 统一文本文件换行符为 LF
#
# 背景：Windows 默认 core.autocrlf=true 会把工作区文件转成 CRLF，
# 而 gofmt 对换行符敏感，会导致 golangci-lint 的格式化校验出现大量误报；
# .sh 脚本在 Linux 下带 CRLF 也会直接执行失败。
# 显式声明 eol=lf 后，git 检出始终使用 LF，各语言的格式化工具结果保持一致。

* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.webp binary
*.jar binary
*.docx binary
*.doc binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.class binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pyc binary
